  _glyph: "\U0001F3A9\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: The Wizard of the Emerald City
  _description: Rules the [[9d4c77c2-5244-4449-b2ef-0ed428ada08e|Emerald City]] and
    appears to every visitor in a different shape. In truth he is a *humbug*, a balloonist
    from Omaha who drifted into Oz and was taken for a great wizard. He leaves in
    his [[73ad0f40-eb72-4e11-a1c5-3fffae4709e6|Balloon]].
